    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just depression though. it's the logic of it. everything i was, and everything i was supposed to become, is dead. you can't just \"talk\" your way back into being someone who matters. when the core of your identity is erased, there's just nothing left to salvage. it feels more like a completed chapter than a phase i'm going through. like the story's just done.",
